{"title":"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 42","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_42&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/9/11980db1a8ae96dfb1ad66493a374d6d2f7dc255.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x =\\sqrt{1+\\sqrt{1+\\sqrt{1+\\sqrt{1+\\cdots}}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"250\" height=\"53\" />, then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/c/adcf1c6af98421ddaf7a474824bee2d41ff5a45a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ x = 1\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 0 &lt; x &lt; 1\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 1 &lt; x &lt; 2\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ x\\text{ is infinite}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"521\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/2/5728fc27b4f112171d48dfc31ee529be869317e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(E)}\\ x &gt; 2\\text{ but finite}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"148\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_42&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/f/dffcf5939c6636f1843ca693b16e6c3fc968a762.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2=1+\\sqrt{1+\\sqrt{1+\\sqrt{1+\\cdots}}}=1+x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"305\" height=\"43\" />. By the quadratic formula, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/8/048cfa6d55059a52ef2aa0b074a6c5fd1c6eb2eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\dfrac{1\\pm \\sqrt{5}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"92\" height=\"41\" />. Because there are only positive square roots in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> must be positive, thus, it is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/8/178ecc288c8f2f4ef14ce940763facd732c9ee83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{1+\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\approx 1.618$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"124\" height=\"41\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/7/737478bf66d27d352ca377146c9d849b86963caa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 1 &lt; x &lt; 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"123\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_42&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME\" title=\"1951 AHSME\">1951 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1951 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1951\">Resources</a>)\n